WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:07.460
You know, you were saying the other day that
you like me.

00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:12.000
Right by the photocopier. You said it.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Yeah.

00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:18.760
Yeah. Did you mean, like, as a friend or
what?

00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:26.030
No. Not just as a friend.

00:00:26.570 --> 00:00:28.880
I thought that might be implied. I just
wasn't sure.

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:35.210
See, I'm

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:43.340
just a little confused about what I feel I
think would be awkward in school if something

00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:44.450
happened with us.

00:00:55.330 --> 00:00:56.620
No one would have to know.

00:01:22.220 --> 00:01:23.000
That was nice.

00:01:25.490 --> 00:01:27.170
All right. What are you laughing for?

00:01:27.410 --> 00:01:29.090
Nothing.

00:01:29.090 --> 00:01:29.840
What are you acting like you've

00:01:29.840 --> 00:01:31.100
